            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court held that neither Arizona\u2019s out\u2011of\u2011precinct rule nor its ballot\u2011collection law violates \u00a72 of the Voting Rights Act."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "eb2b04082193bdd9504dcae829d7cddd88684f276d5a06d69f85691af6d3867e",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-eb2b04082193-0005-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 54,
              "start": 54
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kagan\u2019s dissent highlighted that minority voter participation drops when Section\u202f5 pre\u2011clearance review is removed."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "eb2b04082193bdd9504dcae829d7cddd88684f276d5a06d69f85691af6d3867e",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-eb2b04082193-0006-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 68,
              "start": 68
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kagan, the dissent emphasized that Section\u202f2 requires political processes to be \u201cequally open\u201d to voters of all races."
      }
    ],
