            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kagan, justice Kagan posed several hypotheticals to understand the petitioner\u2019s position, including a scenario where each county has only one polling place."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Barrett",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "55b2508ae388309d74b45f6641632ad6ab468797e777622073ce852eeb5b0c3e",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-55b2508ae388-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 36,
              "start": 36
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Barrett, justice Barrett questioned whether certain time, place, and manner restrictions on voting constitute unlawful burdens on minorities."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "55b2508ae388309d74b45f6641632ad6ab468797e777622073ce852eeb5b0c3e",
            "evidence_ids": [
