            "pages": {
              "end": 48,
              "start": 48
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito asked whether statistics on out\u2011of\u2011precinct voting include only Election\u2011Day voters or also early voters."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "55b2508ae388309d74b45f6641632ad6ab468797e777622073ce852eeb5b0c3e",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-55b2508ae388-0004-0000"
